#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* cspell:ignore Jarman, HIVQE, Cadavid, Chandarana, Leclerc, Sachdeva, HUBO, Filippov, Downfolding, Aharonov, Mundada, Yamauchi, supersymmetric, Paterakis, Gharibyan, Jaffali, Pellow */}\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"* Qiskit Functions are an experimental feature available only to IBM Quantum&reg; Premium Plan, Flex Plan, and On-Prem (via IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan users. They are in preview release status and subject to change.\n"
